[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3190796926","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3190796926","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3190796926,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-L7J-","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T06:58:42Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T06:58:42Z","body":"So far no luck in reproducing it on master, but it can indeed be a nasty little bugger that we're overlooking.\n\nThe problem with the action set is that it takes but one typo, or one path we're allowing that shouldn't be used on a given runtime, that could cause the runtime not to accept the action map (which explains the `OpenXR: failed to attach action sets! [ XR_ERROR_VALIDATION_FAILURE ]` error.  It's an all or nothing deal at that point, an incorrect action map and nothing gets accepted.\n\nIn the steamVR dialog,there is a menu in which you can go to `Developer` and then `Console` (I think its called), this opens up a webbrowser showing the current logs.\nWhen the action map fails, it should tell you in the logs why it fails. If you could paste that here it hopefully will tell us something.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3190796926/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3190876038","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3190876038","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3190876038,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-MOeG","user":{"login":"Fire551","id":52729867,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzI5ODY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52729867?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551","html_url":"https://github.com/Fire551","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T07:53:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T07:54:39Z","body":"just tested my main branch with it (4.5 beta 5, some actions unassigned, might be imported from 4.4, about as unstable as could be)\nbooted with quest 3 using quest link (direct)\ninterestingly the Developer->Web Console would properly send info about setting up the console itself, but would not send a single line any meaningful time before, during or after the bootup of the build. (console.exe and default.exe) \n\nduring the runtime of the game, it properly tracked where my hmd was, and properly rendered. but controllers were unmoving and inputs unrecognized, imagine a marriage joke here.\n\nI'll be busy this weekend, but i think ill be able to squeeze in a build on a seperate computer. \nwhen i get back ill try sending a build to steam, i recall steam can initalize openxr in different ways, might force a binding or something meaningful.\n\nthis is the html of the console. all the lines were mostly related to steamvr setup (not game setup), putting on headset, forgetting where the fuck my controllers are, and taking off headset.\n[SteamVR - Console.html](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21791267/SteamVR.-.Console.html)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3190876038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3190963006","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3190963006","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3190963006,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-Mjs-","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T08:41:51Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T08:41:51Z","body":"Ah ok, you're using quest link, so are you going directly to Metas OpenXR runtime or are you going over SteamVR?\n\nMaybe this is a problem with the Quest Link runtime. I'll do some more testing on this as well. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3190963006/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3192269700","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3192269700","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3192269700,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-RiuE","user":{"login":"Fire551","id":52729867,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzI5ODY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52729867?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551","html_url":"https://github.com/Fire551","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T17:34:25Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T18:14:56Z","body":"ugh, right on the money. that was a brain fart from 4am me. openxr was using meta. retrying with SteamVR as OpenXR gave results, no repeated errors but did provide this which was abnormal.\n`\nFri Aug 15 2025 13:26:00.234 [Error] - [Input] LoadActionManifest failed. Could not find action manifest for app '26608: Synthetic' with key 'system.generated.openxr.synthetic.synthetic.exe'`\n\nhere is the html in case you wanna check for more\n[SteamVR - Console.html](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21800049/SteamVR.-.Console.html)\n\nhere is the exe i used. during building the only abnormal thing i can think of that could mess with finding data is maybe the shader baker being enabled.\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/19SQNbCySAwQjFOyUpx7DYqoF_HlfXTO3/view?usp=sharing\n\nand here is the OpenXR Action set which was used in the project (do note this is not located in the main folder, its in a sub-folder of the project named \"Vr Player\")\n[openxr_action_map.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21800098/openxr_action_map.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3192269700/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206413011","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3206413011","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3206413011,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_HfrT","user":{"login":"devloglogan","id":95497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95497005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan","html_url":"https://github.com/devloglogan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T13:46:03Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T13:46:03Z","body":"Spent some time trying to reproduce this issue and was unsuccessful (except for the SteamVR manifest error mentioned in @Fire551's last comment, but this didn't seem to cause any problems). This is with using the provided MRP and the custom action map uploaded in the last comment.\nI've tried with master / 4.5-beta5 and Quest Link / SteamVR runtimes, in all instances the custom actions seemed to be registering correctly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206413011/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3207883691","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3207883691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3207883691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_NGur","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T19:53:57Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T21:20:01Z","body":"I just did some testing with the MRP and the action map that was attached in the comment above, and I _am_ able to reproduce the issue. I'm using Godot 4.5-beta5 on Windows 11 with a Meta Quest 3, streaming via Steam Link (I didn't try Quest Link).\n\nWhen I launch the project from the editor, it works fine! However, if I export the project (either debug or release - it doesn't seem to matter, despite the original description talking about \"release build\") and run that, the controllers aren't visible, and I get this Godot error spammed to the console:\n\n```\nERROR: Condition \"active_sets.is_empty()\" is true. Returning: false\n   at: sync_action_sets (modules/openxr/openxr_api.cpp:3463)\n```\n\nIt does appear to be loading the action map resource - I see this earlier in the console output:\n\n```\nLoading resource: res://.godot/exported/980071627/export-a9d757fdde490682a87dc1ad8c7d3357-openxr_action_map.res\n```\n\nI wonder, though, if the issue has to be UID <-> path conversion or maybe it's serializing to binary incorrectly? I'll do some more investigation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3207883691/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3207922252","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3207922252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3207922252,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_NQJM","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T20:04:23Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T20:22:50Z","body":"It does seem to be something related to saving or loading the resource.\n\nI added this script to the project:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    var action_map = load(\"res://openxr_action_map.tres\")\n    print(action_map)\n    print(action_map.action_sets)\n    for action_set in action_map.action_sets:\n        print(\"Action Set: \", action_set.localized_name)\n```\n\nWhen I run from the editor, I get:\n\n```\n<OpenXRActionMap#-9223371996069361952>\n[<OpenXRActionSet#-9223372000364329504>]\nAction Set: Godot action set\n```\n\nHowever, when running from the exported project, I get:\n\n```\n<OpenXRActionMap#-9223372001740061345>\n[]\n```\n\nSo, it seems like the exported resource exists, but doesn't contain any action sets, for some reason","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3207922252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3208068337","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3208068337","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3208068337,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_Nzzx","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T20:57:46Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T21:33:01Z","body":"I've discovered something super weird: if I uncheck \"Shader Baker\" -> \"Enabled\" (which is checked in the MRP) in the export settings, then it works fine.\n\nWhen exporting, Godot will generate a `.godot/exported/1234` directory (where `1234` is a random integer), and it'll make a `export-xxx-openxr_action_map.res` file (where `xxx` is a hash).\n\nWith the shader baker is enabled, I can examine the binary `.res` file and see that it's missing all the action sets and interaction profiles. However, when it's disabled, the `.res` file appears to have all the right stuff.\n\nSo, it doesn't seem to be about saving binary resources - that appears to work fine when the shader baker is disabled. But for some reason having the shader baker enabled messes up the resource\n\nThis may not have been noticed by others, because the shader baker looks to be disabled by default when creating a new export preset","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3208068337/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3208095300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3208095300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3208095300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_N6ZE","user":{"login":"Fire551","id":52729867,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzI5ODY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52729867?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551","html_url":"https://github.com/Fire551","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T21:08:56Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T21:20:18Z","body":"fuck, i forgot i originally used shader baker in the MRP because i had a feeling it would be caused by it. totally could've saved everyone time if i recalled i wanted to make a point of it when i originally got the error. \nBut on a testing note, ive tested a build of my game without the shader baker and can confirm that action sets now work on my computer as well. controllers are tracking and i can finally redirect my attention to the other hundred errors that are being called per frame, as god intended.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3208095300/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3212598196","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3212598196","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3212598196,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_fFu0","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T00:55:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T00:55:08Z","body":"Feedback from XR Meeting: Seeing this is somehow triggered by the shader baker and nobody is experiencing this unless the shader baker is enabled, we feel this lowers the priority and this should not be considered a showstopper for 4.5 release.\n\nWe also wonder if this could be related to the resource cache being cleared and loosing the action map data that way? If so there may be other systems effected as well.\n\nWe'll look into this further.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3212598196/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3229203757","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3229203757","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3229203757,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Aeb0t","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T18:01:49Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T18:01:49Z","body":"> We also wonder if this could be related to the resource cache being cleared and loosing the action map data that way? If so there may be other systems effected as well.\n\nI'm thinking this is something along these lines. Shader baker makes use of an export system that was there but not used by anything else which is the export plugins. It's probable that using export plugins at all can lead to breaking other unrelated things we hadn't caught before because editor export plugins aren't regularly used until now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3229203757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3233923871","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3233923871","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3233923871,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AwcMf","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T15:15:21Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T15:15:21Z","body":"As expected, the bug wasn't exactly the shader baker itself, but rather the usage of editor export plugins in general triggering a pretty hard to trace bug.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110057\n\nThe core of the issue was that the exporter sets back arrays or dictionaries without actually making a copy of the array or dictionary, and not all classes are quite ready to handle a case like that, the OpenXR Action Map object being one of them. Since this is pretty much how Arrays or Dictionaries work in general and they're not entirely CoW, the best way to fix it is to just not set it again if the element is the same reference or equivalent.\n\nPlease try the PR above and let me know if it fixes the issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3233923871/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3235418808","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109107#issuecomment-3235418808","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107","id":3235418808,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7A2JK4","user":{"login":"Fire551","id":52729867,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzI5ODY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52729867?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551","html_url":"https://github.com/Fire551","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-29T01:27:24Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T01:27:24Z","body":"compiled from #110057 source and tested with the MRP, can confirm I can compile the release with shader baker and controllers track. Tested with Quest link and Steam VR.\ncouldn't demo with my main project unfortunately due to my recent sickness of \"i spent an hour compiling release templates why did I tell it to compile every combination\" making me unable to compile for .NET. which my project uses.\n\nI personally consider this issue completed? cant wait for release candidate!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3235418808/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]